{"seq":1,"slug":"backpressure-flow-control","title":"背压与流量控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/message-queue-async-patterns/engineering/backpressure-flow-control","wordCount":703,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"背压与流量控制\">背压与流量控制</h1><p>在异步消息系统中，生产者和消费者以各自的速率独立运行。当生产者速率持续超过消费者处理能力时，消息在队列中积压，内存压力上升，最终可能导致系统崩溃。<strong>背压（Backpressure）</strong> 是一种从下游向上游传递&quot;我处理不过来了&quot;信号的机制，迫使生产者降速或阻塞，防止积压失控。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>背压</td>\n<td>下游向上游传递&quot;处理过载&quot;信号，迫使上游减速的机制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>消费者 Lag</td>\n<td>生产端与消费端 offset 之差，反映积压程度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>QoS Prefetch</td>\n<td>消费者预取消息数上限，控制未确认消息的积压量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>令牌桶</td>\n<td>允许短时突发但限制平均速率的流量控制算法</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>漏桶</td>\n<td>严格匀速输出的流量整形算法，保护下游稳定</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"背压的本质\">背压的本质</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    UP[上游生产者\\n100 msg/s] --&gt;|消息| MQ[消息队列\\n缓冲区]&#10;    MQ --&gt;|消息| DOWN[下游消费者\\n20 msg/s]&#10;    DOWN --&gt;|背压信号| MQ&#10;    MQ --&gt;|背压传播| UP\">flowchart LR\n    UP[上游生产者\\n100 msg/s] --&gt;|消息| MQ[消息队列\\n缓冲区]\n    MQ --&gt;|消息| DOWN[下游消费者\\n20 msg/s]\n    DOWN --&gt;|背压信号| MQ\n    MQ --&gt;|背压传播| UP</pre><p><strong>没有背压</strong>：队列无限积压 → 内存耗尽 → OOM。<br><strong>有背压</strong>：积压达到阈值 → 传递信号 → 上游降速或阻塞。</p>\n<h2 id=\"消费者端流量控制\">消费者端流量控制</h2><p><strong>RabbitMQ QoS prefetch</strong>：控制消费者未确认消息数，防止消费者被淹没：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"// 每次最多预取 20 条，全部 ACK 后才拉取新消息&#10;ch.Qos(20, 0, false)&#10;// prefetchCount=20, prefetchSize=0(不限大小), global=false(per-consumer)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 每次最多预取 20 条，全部 ACK 后才拉取新消息</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ch.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Qos</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// prefetchCount=20, prefetchSize=0(不限大小), global=false(per-consumer)</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Kafka 消费者速率控制</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"// 通过 poll 间隔控制消费速率&#10;for {&#10;    msg, _ := reader.FetchMessage(ctx)&#10;&#10;    startTime := time.Now()&#10;    process(msg)&#10;    elapsed := time.Since(startTime)&#10;&#10;    // 若处理过快，主动 sleep 避免过度消费&#10;    targetInterval := time.Second / 100 // 目标 100 msg/s&#10;    if elapsed &lt; targetInterval {&#10;        time.Sleep(targetInterval - elapsed)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    reader.CommitMessages(ctx, msg)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 通过 poll 间隔控制消费速率</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    msg, _ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reader.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">FetchMessage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    startTime </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> time.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    process</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(msg)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    elapsed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> time.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Since</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(startTime)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 若处理过快，主动 sleep 避免过度消费</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    targetInterval </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> time.Second </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> // 目标 100 msg/s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> elapsed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> targetInterval {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        time.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Sleep</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(targetInterval </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> elapsed)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    reader.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">CommitMessages</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx, msg)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Semaphore 并发限制</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"const MaxConcurrent = 50&#10;sem := make(chan struct{}, MaxConcurrent)&#10;&#10;for msg := range messages {&#10;    sem &lt;- struct{}{} // 获取许可&#10;    go func(m Message) {&#10;        defer func() { &lt;-sem }() // 释放许可&#10;        processMessage(m)&#10;    }(msg)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> MaxConcurrent</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 50</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">sem </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> make</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">chan</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{}, MaxConcurrent)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> msg </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> messages {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    sem </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;-</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{}{} </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 获取许可</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    go</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">m</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Message</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        defer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() { </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">sem }() </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 释放许可</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        processMessage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(m)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }(msg)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"生产者端背压\">生产者端背压</h2><p>当队列积压超过阈值，生产者应主动降速：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"type BackpressureProducer struct {&#10;    writer    *kafka.Writer&#10;    rateLimit *rate.Limiter // golang.org/x/time/rate&#10;    monitor   QueueMonitor&#10;}&#10;&#10;func (p *BackpressureProducer) Send(ctx context.Context, msg kafka.Message) error {&#10;    lag, _ := p.monitor.GetLag()&#10;&#10;    // 根据积压量动态调整速率&#10;    switch {&#10;    case lag &gt; 100000:&#10;        p.rateLimit.SetLimit(rate.Limit(100))  // 严重积压：100 msg/s&#10;    case lag &gt; 10000:&#10;        p.rateLimit.SetLimit(rate.Limit(1000)) // 中等积压：1000 msg/s&#10;    default:&#10;        p.rateLimit.SetLimit(rate.Inf)         // 正常：无限速&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    if err := p.rateLimit.Wait(ctx); err != nil {&#10;        return err&#10;    }&#10;    return p.writer.WriteMessages(ctx, msg)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BackpressureProducer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    writer    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kafka</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Writer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    rateLimit </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">rate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Limiter</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> // golang.org/x/time/rate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    monitor   </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">QueueMonitor</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">p </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">BackpressureProducer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Send</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ctx</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">msg</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> kafka</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Message</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    lag, _ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p.monitor.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">GetLag</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 根据积压量动态调整速率</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    switch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lag </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        p.rateLimit.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">SetLimit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(rate.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Limit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 严重积压：100 msg/s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lag </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        p.rateLimit.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">SetLimit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(rate.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Limit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 中等积压：1000 msg/s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    default</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        p.rateLimit.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">SetLimit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(rate.Inf)         </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 正常：无限速</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p.rateLimit.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Wait</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx); err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> err</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p.writer.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">WriteMessages</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx, msg)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"缓冲区设计与积压阈值\">缓冲区设计与积压阈值</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>积压级别</th>\n<th>阈值（消息数）</th>\n<th>处理策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>正常</td>\n<td>&lt; 1,000</td>\n<td>无干预</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>轻度积压</td>\n<td>1,000–10,000</td>\n<td>告警，增加消费者实例</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中度积压</td>\n<td>10,000–100,000</td>\n<td>限制生产者速率，扩容消费者</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>严重积压</td>\n<td>&gt; 100,000</td>\n<td>触发熔断，停止非关键生产者</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"流量整形模式\">流量整形模式</h2><p><strong>令牌桶（Token Bucket）</strong>：允许短时突发，但限制平均速率——适合 API 调用频率控制：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"limiter := rate.NewLimiter(rate.Limit(1000), 5000) // 1000/s，峰值 5000&#10;if err := limiter.Wait(ctx); err != nil {&#10;    return ErrRateLimited&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">limiter </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rate.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">NewLimiter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(rate.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Limit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 1000/s，峰值 5000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> limiter.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Wait</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx); err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ErrRateLimited</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>漏桶（Leaky Bucket）</strong>：严格匀速输出，适合向下游服务发送消息时保护下游：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"// 固定速率写入下游&#10;ticker := time.NewTicker(time.Millisecond) // 1000/s&#10;defer ticker.Stop()&#10;&#10;for msg := range inputChan {&#10;    &lt;-ticker.C // 等待下一个时间窗口&#10;    forwardToDownstream(msg)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 固定速率写入下游</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ticker </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> time.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">NewTicker</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(time.Millisecond) </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 1000/s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">defer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ticker.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Stop</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> msg </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> inputChan {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    &#x3C;-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ticker.C </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 等待下一个时间窗口</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    forwardToDownstream</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(msg)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"弹性扩缩容与背压联动\">弹性扩缩容与背压联动</h2><p>消息积压是触发自动扩缩容的天然信号。KEDA（Kubernetes Event-Driven Autoscaling）直接基于 Kafka/RabbitMQ Lag 触发 Pod 扩容：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"apiVersion: keda.sh/v1alpha1&#10;kind: ScaledObject&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: payment-consumer&#10;spec:&#10;  scaleTargetRef:&#10;    name: payment-consumer-deployment&#10;  minReplicaCount: 1&#10;  maxReplicaCount: 20&#10;  triggers:&#10;    - type: kafka&#10;      metadata:&#10;        bootstrapServers: kafka:9092&#10;        consumerGroup: payment-service&#10;        topic: orders.process&#10;        lagThreshold: &#39;1000&#39; # 每实例积压超 1000 条时触发扩容\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">keda.sh/v1alpha1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ScaledObject</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">payment-consumer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  scaleTargetRef</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">payment-consumer-deployment</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  minReplicaCount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  maxReplicaCount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  triggers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">kafka</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        bootstrapServers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">kafka:9092</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        consumerGroup</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">payment-service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        topic</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">orders.process</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        lagThreshold</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'1000'</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 每实例积压超 1000 条时触发扩容</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"背压监控指标\">背压监控指标</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>队列深度（Queue Depth）</strong>：核心指标，持续增长说明消费能力不足</li>\n<li><strong>消费者 Lag</strong>：对 Kafka 尤其重要</li>\n<li><strong>消费速率 vs 生产速率</strong>：两者差值是积压增长速率</li>\n<li><strong>处理时间 P99</strong>：消费者处理单条消息耗时，识别处理瓶颈</li>\n</ul>\n<p>与<a href=\"async-observability\">异步系统可观测性</a>配合建立完整监控体系。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>背压是异步系统可靠性的核心机制，防止快速生产者压垮慢速消费者。实践中结合 QoS prefetch 控制消费者端流量、动态限速控制生产者端速率、并基于积压阈值触发弹性扩缩容，构建自适应的流量控制体系。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"背压与流量控制","id":"背压与流量控制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"背压的本质","id":"背压的本质"},{"level":2,"text":"消费者端流量控制","id":"消费者端流量控制"},{"level":2,"text":"生产者端背压","id":"生产者端背压"},{"level":2,"text":"缓冲区设计与积压阈值","id":"缓冲区设计与积压阈值"},{"level":2,"text":"流量整形模式","id":"流量整形模式"},{"level":2,"text":"弹性扩缩容与背压联动","id":"弹性扩缩容与背压联动"},{"level":2,"text":"背压监控指标","id":"背压监控指标"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Redis Streams 与 NATS 消息系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/message-queue-async-patterns/systems/redis-streams-nats"},"next":{"title":"消息 Schema 演进策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/message-queue-async-patterns/engineering/message-schema-evolution"}}